+/* ---- Optional TorchScript runtime knobs (all default to libtorch's own
+ * defaults when the env var is unset).  See BUILD.local.md.
+ *   NAMD_MLFF_JIT_PROFILING=0     legacy executor (getExecutorMode/getProfilingMode = false)
